Value LOCAL_PORT (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value PORT_ID (\S+)
Value SYSTEM_NAME (\S+)
Value CAPS ([A-Za-z]+(?:, [A-Za-z]+)*)
Value TTL (\d+)

Start
  ^\s*${LOCAL_PORT}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${PORT_ID}\s+${SYSTEM_NAME}\s+${CAPS}\s+${TTL}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${LOCAL_PORT}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${PORT_ID}\s+${CAPS}\s+${TTL}\s*$$ -> Record
